      "target": "../sections/page-006.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "Counselling for HIV/AIDS: A key to caring\n\nACKNOWLEDGEMENTS\n\nWHO wishes to thank Mr Tom Milroy, an independent consultant specializing in\nplanning of health systems and public health policy, for his invaluable contribution to this\npublication. The organization is grateful to many people living with AIDS, care-givers and\nAIDS care services managers without whose work the information presented in this book\nwould not have been generated.\n\nSpecial mention should also be made of the following people who contributed to the\n1990 version and to this revised version of WHO AIDS Series No. 8:\n\nMr Alfred",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Acknowledges the independent consultant who contributed to the counselling guidelines and the people living with AIDS, care-givers and service managers whose work informed them. It also lists reviewers and contributors from organizations in several countries.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
