      "target": "../sections/page-007.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "WHO/GPA/TCO/HCS/95. 15\n\nINTRODUCTION\n\nWho is this document intended for?\n\nThese guidelines are intended to provide policy-makers and planners working in\nhealth and social service organizations! with information to enable them to develop policies\nthat will stimulate, encourage and support the development of appropriate HIV/AIDS\ncounselling services and plan for this service.\n\nThis document presents general policy issues in the area of HIV/AIDS counselling.\nThe aim is to encourage countries to develop programme-linked policies and operational\nguidance for the provision of counselling, It is not",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Introduces the guidelines, explaining that they are intended for policy-makers and planners in health and social services to help them develop policies supporting HIV/AIDS counselling services. It notes they may also interest managers and clinicians involved in policy-making.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "not-disclosed"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-11"
